<view class="page">
  <view class="hero">
    <view class="logo">财</view>
    <text class="hero-title">{{mode === 'edit' ? '企业资料' : '开始使用小微财报'}}</text>
    <text class="hero-desc">每月填一次，快速生成资产负债表、利润表和经营分析</text>
  </view>

  <view class="card form-card">
    <view class="field-block">
      <text class="field-label">企业名称</text>
      <input
        class="text-input"
        value="{{name}}"
        maxlength="40"
        placeholder="例如：柠月商贸有限公司"
        placeholder-class="placeholder"
        bindinput="onNameInput"
      />
    </view>

    <view class="field-block">
      <text class="field-label">所属行业</text>
      <picker range="{{industries}}" value="{{industryIndex}}" bindchange="onIndustryChange">
        <view class="picker-value">
          <text>{{industries[industryIndex]}}</text>
          <text class="arrow">›</text>
        </view>
      </picker>
    </view>

    <view class="field-block no-border">
      <text class="field-label">启用月份</text>
      <picker mode="date" fields="month" value="{{startMonth}}" end="{{maxMonth}}" bindchange="onMonthChange">
        <view class="picker-value">
          <text>{{startMonth}}</text>
          <text class="arrow">›</text>
        </view>
      </picker>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="privacy-tip">
    <text class="privacy-title">MVP 数据说明</text>
    <text>当前版本的数据保存在本机，用于产品验证。正式商用版需接入云端数据库、成员权限和自动备份。</text>
  </view>

  <view class="btn-primary save-btn" bindtap="onSave">{{saving ? '保存中…' : '保存并开始'}}</view>
</view>
